Name: Starlink
Version: 0.1.0
Requires:
  Libraries: icinga-php-library (>=0.14.0), icinga-php-thirdparty (>=0.12.0)
  Modules: map
Description: Starlink enterprise telemetry for Icinga
 Collects the Starlink Public API v2 telemetry stream into PostgreSQL via a
 background daemon, provides a terminal browser for site techs, a Director
 import source and a DB-backed check command (failover activity detection
 and bandwidth perfdata).
